8491000832681425.jpeg/o59jen28yBV3fqXH_XQd3k4CNUgNQ_ze0pkNesSZDXo\"/><figcaption>賊人撬開密碼鎖在箱內取走鎖匙進入自提點搜掠。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-26T13:18:32.323712+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1632,"images":17,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}